## Optional: enables real Google Places restaurant search on the search screen.
## Without this set, the search screen falls back to sample demo data.
## Get a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/ with the "Places API" enabled.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

## Optional: enables automatic Tabit/Ontopo reservation-link lookup for each
## restaurant, via Google's Custom Search API. Without this set, restaurants
## fall back to a phone link (or a manually-entered link via the pencil icon
## on each restaurant). Enable "Custom Search API" for the same API key above,
## then create a search engine at https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
## (set it to search the entire web) and copy its Search engine ID here.
VITE_GOOGLE_SEARCH_ENGINE_ID=

## Required for real accounts and list sharing. Create a free project at
## https://supabase.com, run supabase/schema.sql in its SQL Editor, then copy
## these from Project Settings -> API. Use the "anon public" key, never the
## "service_role" key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
